 How do I calculate the limit? 

Answer: \begin{eqnarray*}
  F_Z \left( z \right) & = & \int F_X  \left( z - y
  \right) dF_Y \left( y \right)\\
  & = & \int F_Y  \left( z - x \right) dF_X \left( x
  \right)
\end{eqnarray*} 
