I have arrived at this: 
 $$M(n) = \begin{cases}
 - 1 + M\left(\frac{n}{2}\right) & \text{if $n$ even}\\
 - 2 + M\left(\frac{n-1}{2}\right) & \text{if $n$ odd}
\end{cases}
$$ 
 with initial conditions $M(1) = 0$ and $M(2) = 1$. 
 so how do I solve this?
Thanks for any help! 

