{"input_text": "Question: How to calculate this improper integral 
$$
\int_{0}^{\infty}{\rm e}^{-\left(ax\ +\ b/x\right)^2}\,{\rm d}x\ {\large ?}
$$ 

Answer: $\newcommand{\+}{^{\dagger}}
 \newcommand{\angles}[1]{\left\langle\, #1 \,\right\rangle}
