Answer: \begin{align}
L &=\lim_{x \rightarrow (-1)^{+}}\frac{\sqrt{\pi}-\sqrt{\cos^{-1}x}}{\sqrt{x+1}}\\
&=\lim_{t \rightarrow 0^{+}}\frac{\sqrt{\pi}-\sqrt{\cos^{-1}(t-1)}}{\sqrt{t}}\\
&= \lim_{t \rightarrow 0^{+}}\frac{\sqrt{\pi}-\sqrt{\pi}+\frac{\sqrt{t}}{\sqrt{2\pi}}+o(t)}{\sqrt{t}}\\
&= \frac{1}{\sqrt{2\pi}}
\end{align} 
